"class='mono'>0.0.0.0</span> = sinkhole; <span class='mono'>*.reklam.com</"
"span> = tüm alt alanlar. Engel/izin listelerinden önceliklidir."
msgstr ""
"Manually defined record: point a domain to a fixed IP or another domain "
"(like a local <span class='mono'>/etc/hosts</span>). <span "
"class='mono'>0.0.0.0</span> = sinkhole; <span class='mono'>*.ads.com</span> "
"= all subdomains. Takes priority over block/allow lists."

