#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:48
msgid "Domain'i iki ayrı iş için kullanırsın; ikisini karıştırma:"
msgstr "You use the domain for two separate jobs; don't mix them:"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:50
msgid "DNS servisi"
msgstr "DNS service"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:50
msgid ""
"dns.example.com → istemcilerin şifreli DNS için bağlandığı ad (DoT/DoH/DoQ). "
"Sertifika bu ada göre."
msgstr ""
"dns.example.com → the name clients connect to for encrypted DNS (DoT/DoH/"
"DoQ). The certificate is for this name."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:51
msgid "Panel (opsiyonel)"
msgstr "Panel (optional)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:51
msgid "panel.example.com → bu yönetim arayüzü (HTTP/HTTPS)."
msgstr "panel.example.com → this management interface (HTTP/HTTPS)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:53
msgid ""
"Aynı domaini ikisi için de kullanabilirsin ama <b>ayrı alt alan</b> daha "
"temiz ve güvenli (paneli DNS'ten bağımsız koruyabilirsin)."
msgstr ""
"You can use the same domain for both, but a <b>separate subdomain</b> is "
"cleaner and safer (you can protect the panel independently of DNS)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:54
msgid ""
"Bir <b>A kaydı</b> için sunucunun public IP'si gerekir. Public IP/port açmak "
"istemiyorsan <a href='#tunnel' style='color:var(--accent)'>Cloudflare "
"Tunnel</a> bölümüne bak."
msgstr ""
"An <b>A record</b> needs the server's public IP. If you don't want to expose "
"a public IP/port, see the <a href='#tunnel' style='color:var(--"
"accent)'>Cloudflare Tunnel</a> section."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:58
msgid "DNS kayıtları &amp; Cloudflare proxy"
msgstr "DNS records &amp; Cloudflare proxy"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:59
msgid ""
"Domain sağlayıcında (ör. Cloudflare) her kaydın <b>proxy</b> durumu kritik: "
"<span class='cloud grey'>DNS only · gri</span> mi yoksa <span class='cloud "
"orange'>Proxied · turuncu</span> mu. Cloudflare proxy'si <b>yalnız HTTP(S)</"
"b> taşır."
msgstr ""
"At your domain provider (e.g. Cloudflare) each record's <b>proxy</b> status "
"is critical: <span class='cloud grey'>DNS only · grey</span> or <span "
"class='cloud orange'>Proxied · orange</span>. The Cloudflare proxy carries "
"<b>only HTTP(S)</b>."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:61
msgid "DoT &amp; DoQ (port 853) — proxy KAPALI"
msgstr "DoT &amp; DoQ (port 853) — proxy OFF"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:62
msgid ""
"DoT/DoQ ham TLS/QUIC'tir, HTTP değil → proxy bunları <b>taşıyamaz</b>. "
"Doğrudan A kaydı + açık 853 şart:"
msgstr ""
"DoT/DoQ are raw TLS/QUIC, not HTTP → the proxy <b>can't carry</b> them. A "
"direct A record + open 853 is required:"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:64
#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:73
#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:80
msgid "Kayıt"
msgstr "Record"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:64
#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:73
msgid "sunucu-ip"
msgstr "server-ip"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:65
#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:74
#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:81
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "Proxy"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:65
msgid "DNS only · gri bulut"
msgstr "DNS only · grey cloud"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:66
msgid "Açık port"
msgstr "Open port"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:68
msgid ""
"Bu kaydı <span class='cloud orange'>turuncu</span> bırakırsan DoT/DoQ "
"istemcileri <b>bağlanamaz</b>. Bulut <b>gri</b> olmalı."
msgstr ""
"If you leave this record <span class='cloud orange'>orange</span>, DoT/DoQ "
"clients <b>can't connect</b>. The cloud must be <b>grey</b>."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:70
msgid "DoH (port 443) — proxy AÇIK olabilir"
msgstr "DoH (port 443) — proxy MAY be ON"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:71
msgid ""
"DoH, HTTPS üzerindedir; tek istisna budur. Proxy açık ya da tünel ile "
"çalışır:"
msgstr ""
"DoH runs over HTTPS; that's the only exception. It works with proxy on or "
"via a tunnel:"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:74
#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:81
msgid "Proxied · turuncu"
msgstr "Proxied · orange"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:74
msgid "ya da tünel"
msgstr "or tunnel"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:75
msgid "Adres"
msgstr "Address"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:78
msgid "Panel (443) — proxy AÇIK"
msgstr "Panel (443) — proxy ON"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:80
msgid "sunucu / tünel"
msgstr "server / tunnel"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:81
msgid "(TLS + IP gizleme)"
msgstr "(TLS + IP hiding)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:83
msgid ""
"Paneli Cloudflare <b>Access</b> (SSO / e-posta doğrulama) arkasına al — "
"panel login'inin önüne ikinci kapı."
msgstr ""
"Put the panel behind Cloudflare <b>Access</b> (SSO / email verification) — a "
"second door in front of the panel login."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:85
msgid "Özet"
msgstr "Summary"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:86
msgid "Yöntem   Std. port   Cloudflare proxy      Kayıt"
msgstr "Method   Std. port   Cloudflare proxy      Record"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:87
msgid "✗ KAPALI (gri bulut)   A → sunucu IP, 853 açık"
msgstr "✗ OFF (grey cloud)     A → server IP, 853 open"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:88
msgid "✗ KAPALI (gri bulut)   A → sunucu IP, 853/udp açık"
msgstr "✗ OFF (grey cloud)     A → server IP, 853/udp open"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:89
msgid "✓ AÇIK / tünel         A → sunucu IP ya da tünel"
msgstr "✓ ON / tunnel          A → server IP or tunnel"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:90
msgid "✓ AÇIK / tünel         A/CNAME + Access"
msgstr "✓ ON / tunnel          A/CNAME + Access"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:91
msgid "✗ (proxy yok)          genelde public açılmaz"
msgstr "✗ (no proxy)           usually not exposed publicly"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:92
msgid ""
"Kısa kural: <b>DoT/DoQ = gri bulut</b>, <b>DoH/panel = turuncu ya da tünel</"
"b>."
msgstr ""
"Quick rule: <b>DoT/DoQ = grey cloud</b>, <b>DoH/panel = orange or tunnel</b>."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:97
msgid ""
"Şifreli yöntemler, <b>bağladığın domaine ait</b> geçerli bir TLS sertifikası "
"ister. Sertifikanın adı (CN/SAN) istemcinin bağlandığı adla <b>birebir</b> "
"aynı olmalı — yoksa istemci doğrulaması başarısız olur."
msgstr ""
"Encrypted methods need a valid TLS certificate <b>for the domain you "
"connect</b>. The certificate name (CN/SAN) must <b>exactly</b> match the "
"name the client connects to — otherwise client verification fails."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:99
msgid "çıktı:"
msgstr "output:"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:100
msgid "bu dosyaları projedeki certificates/ altına koy"
msgstr "put these files under the project's certificates/"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:101
msgid ""
"Ardından panelden bağla: <b>DNS Ayarları → Sertifika</b> → yolları gir → "
"<b>Doğrulama</b> kartında <b>GEÇERLİ</b> + <b>Özne (CN)</b> = "
"<code>dns.example.com</code> gör."
msgstr ""
"Then connect it from the panel: <b>DNS Settings → Certificate</b> → enter "
"the paths → see <b>VALID</b> + <b>Subject (CN)</b> = <code>dns.example.com</"
"code> on the <b>Verification</b> card."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:102
msgid ""
"Sertifika <code>dns.example.com</code> için ama istemci "
"<code>baska.example.com</code>'a bağlanırsa TLS doğrulaması patlar. Cert adı "
"= bağlanılan ad."
msgstr ""
"If the certificate is for <code>dns.example.com</code> but the client "
"connects to <code>other.example.com</code>, TLS verification breaks. Cert "
"name = connected name."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:107
msgid ""
"Kaydı + sertifikayı ayarladıktan sonra <b>Sunucular</b>'dan ilgili yöntemi "
"aç, sonra domain üzerinden test et. İstemciler <b>standart portları</b> (DoT/"
"DoQ 853, DoH 443) kullanır:"
msgstr ""
"After setting the record + certificate, enable the method from <b>Servers</"
"b>, then test over the domain. Clients use the <b>standard ports</b> (DoT/"
"DoQ 853, DoH 443):"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:116
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Dış (host) port eşlemen bu standart portları konteynerin <b>iç dinleme "
"portlarına</b> yönlendirmeli: DoT 853→<code>%(dot)s</code>, DoH "
"443→<code>%(doh)s</code>, DoQ 853→<code>%(doq)s</code>. Eşleme "
"<code>compose.override.yml</code>'dedir; iç portlar <b>Sunucular</b> "
"sayfasından ayarlanır."
msgstr ""
"Your external (host) port mapping must forward these standard ports to the "
"container's <b>internal listening ports</b>: DoT 853→<code>%(dot)s</code>, "
"DoH 443→<code>%(doh)s</code>, DoQ 853→<code>%(doq)s</code>. The mapping is "
"in <code>compose.override.yml</code>; internal ports are set from the "
"<b>Servers</b> page."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:120
msgid "İstemciyi domaine yönlendir"
msgstr "Point the client at the domain"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:121
msgid "Artık cihaz/uygulamalarda çözümleyici adresi olarak domaini gir:"
msgstr "Now enter the domain as the resolver address in devices/apps:"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:123
msgid "Ayarlar → Özel DNS (Private DNS) → dns.example.com  (DoT)"
msgstr "Settings → Private DNS → dns.example.com  (DoT)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:124
msgid "Ayarlar → DoH → Özel → https://dns.example.com/dns-query"
msgstr "Settings → DoH → Custom → https://dns.example.com/dns-query"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:125
msgid "DoH/DoT .mobileconfig profili (dns.example.com)"
msgstr "DoH/DoT .mobileconfig profile (dns.example.com)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:128
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bir engelleyicinin (AdGuard Home / Pi-hole) arkasına recursive upstream "
"olarak koyacaksan, dns-net içinde <code>%(ip)s:%(udp)s</code> de "
"kullanılabilir (domain gerekmez)."
msgstr ""
"If you'll place it behind a blocker (AdGuard Home / Pi-hole) as the "
"recursive upstream, <code>%(ip)s:%(udp)s</code> on dns-net can also be used "
"(no domain needed)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:132
msgid "Cloudflare Tunnel (public IP/port yoksa)"
msgstr "Cloudflare Tunnel (no public IP/port)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:133
msgid ""
"Sunucuya doğrudan port açamıyorsan <code>cloudflared</code> tüneli DoH ve "
"paneli yayınlayabilir; A kaydı/açık port gerekmez."
msgstr ""
"If you can't open a port directly to the server, a <code>cloudflared</code> "
"tunnel can publish DoH and the panel; no A record/open port needed."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:134
msgid ""
"Tünel <b>HTTP-only</b>'dir → yalnız <b>DoH + panel</b> çalışır. <b>DoT/DoQ "
"tünelden geçmez</b>; onlar için doğrudan A kaydı (<span class='cloud "
"grey'>gri</span>) + açık 853 şarttır."
msgstr ""
"The tunnel is <b>HTTP-only</b> → only <b>DoH + panel</b> work. <b>DoT/DoQ "
"don't pass through a tunnel</b>; they require a direct A record (<span "
"class='cloud grey'>grey</span>) + open 853."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:138
msgid "Sık yapılan hatalar"
msgstr "Common mistakes"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:140
msgid ""
"<b>DoT/DoQ kaydı turuncu (proxied):</b> istemci bağlanamaz — <span "
"class='cloud grey'>gri bulut</span> yap."
msgstr ""
"<b>DoT/DoQ record orange (proxied):</b> the client can't connect — make it a "
"<span class='cloud grey'>grey cloud</span>."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:141
msgid ""
"<b>Sertifika adı ≠ bağlanılan ad:</b> TLS doğrulama hatası — cert'i doğru "
"domaine al."
msgstr ""
"<b>Cert name ≠ connected name:</b> TLS verification error — get the cert for "
"the right domain."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:142
msgid ""
"<b>Yalnız tünel + DoT beklemek:</b> tünel DoT/DoQ taşımaz; doğrudan port aç."
msgstr ""
"<b>Expecting DoT over a tunnel only:</b> a tunnel doesn't carry DoT/DoQ; "
"open a direct port."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:143
msgid ""
"<b>853 güvenlik duvarında kapalı:</b> DoT/DoQ dışarıdan erişilemez — 853/"
"tcp+udp aç."
msgstr ""
"<b>853 blocked by the firewall:</b> DoT/DoQ unreachable from outside — open "
"853/tcp+udp."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:144
msgid ""
"<b>Panel public + auth'suz:</b> paneli tünel/proxy + Access ile koru, yalnız "
"domain arkasına al."
msgstr ""
"<b>Panel public + no auth:</b> protect the panel with tunnel/proxy + Access, "
"keep it behind a domain only."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/guide.html:157
msgid "Kopyalandı ✓"
msgstr "Copied ✓"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/login.html:17
#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/users.html:48
msgid "Kullanıcı adı"
