#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:8
msgid ""
"Çözümleme davranışı: kendi çekirdek mi çözsün yoksa upstream'e mi iletsin, "
"strateji, koşullu yönlendirme ve bootstrap DNS. Değişiklikler resolver'a ~10 "
"sn içinde yansır (yeniden başlatma yok)."
msgstr ""
"Resolution behavior: resolve with our own core or forward to an upstream, "
"strategy, conditional forwarding and bootstrap DNS. Changes reach the "
"resolver within ~10 s (no restart)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:22
msgid "Kendi çekirdeğimizi kullan"
msgstr "Use our own core"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:23
msgid ""
"Açık: recursive çözümleyici (root→TLD→yetkili sunucuları kendi yürür). "
"Kapalı: sorguları aşağıdaki upstream sunuculara iletir (forwarding)."
msgstr ""
"On: recursive resolver (walks root→TLD→authoritative itself). Off: forwards "
"queries to the upstream servers below (forwarding)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:28
msgid "Upstream sunucular (satır başına bir tane)"
msgstr "Upstream servers (one per line)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:30
msgid "Her satırın başına <b>yöntem</b> yazabilirsin (AdGuard gibi):"
msgstr "You can prefix each line with a <b>method</b> (like AdGuard):"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:32
msgid ""
"Ön ek yoksa <b>düz UDP/53</b>. Port için <span class='mono'>host:port</span> "
"(varsayılan port: UDP/TCP <b>53</b>, DoT/DoQ <b>853</b>). Yalnız 'Kendi "
"çekirdeğimizi kullan' KAPALIYKEN devreye girer."
msgstr ""
"No prefix means <b>plain UDP/53</b>. For a port use <span "
"class='mono'>host:port</span> (default port: UDP/TCP <b>53</b>, DoT/DoQ "
"<b>853</b>). Only active while 'Use our own core' is OFF."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:33
msgid "(DoQ) şu an <b>deneysel — henüz desteklenmiyor</b> (girilirse atlanır)."
msgstr ""
"(DoQ) is currently <b>experimental — not yet supported</b> (skipped if "
"entered)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:34
msgid "Kendi adresini upstream yazma."
msgstr "Don't put your own address as an upstream."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:34
msgid ""
"ve bu sunucunun kendi IP'si (Docker container adresi) resolver'ın "
"<b>KENDİSİDİR</b> → sorgu kendine iletilip <b>sonsuz döngüye</b> girer (tek "
"sorgu defalarca loglanır). Upstream, 'çözemezsem soracağım <b>başka</b> bir "
"sunucu' olmalıdır."
msgstr ""
"and this server's own IP (the Docker container address) IS the resolver "
"<b>ITSELF</b> → the query is forwarded to itself and enters an <b>infinite "
"loop</b> (a single query is logged many times). An upstream must be 'another "
"server I ask when I can't resolve'."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:36
msgid "Sorgu stratejisi (forwarding)"
msgstr "Query strategy (forwarding)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:38
msgid "<b>Sıra sıra</b> — listedeki ilk yanıtlayanı kullan (en az trafik)"
msgstr ""
"<b>Sequential</b> — use the first in the list that answers (least traffic)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:39
msgid ""
"<b>Paralel</b> — hepsine aynı anda sor, ilk gelen cevabı al (en düşük "
"gecikme)"
msgstr ""
"<b>Parallel</b> — ask all at once, take the first answer (lowest latency)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:40
msgid "<b>En hızlı</b> — ölçülen ortalamaya göre en hızlı upstream'i önce dene"
msgstr "<b>Fastest</b> — try the fastest upstream first by measured average"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:43
msgid "Koşullu yönlendirme (son-ek → upstream)"
msgstr "Conditional forwarding (suffix → upstream)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:45
msgid ""
"Satır başına <span class='mono'>son-ek&nbsp;upstream</span>. Eşleşen domain "
"(ve tüm alt alanları) <b>her zaman</b> o upstream'e çözdürülür — 'Kendi "
"çekirdeğimizi kullan' açık olsa bile. Yerel/özel alanlar için (ör. <span "
"class='mono'>*.home.arpa → 192.168.1.1</span>). En uzun eşleşen son-ek "
"kazanır."
msgstr ""
"One <span class='mono'>suffix&nbsp;upstream</span> per line. The matching "
"domain (and all its subdomains) is <b>always</b> resolved via that upstream "
"— even when 'Use our own core' is on. For local/private zones (e.g. <span "
"class='mono'>*.home.arpa → 192.168.1.1</span>). The longest matching suffix "
"wins."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:47
msgid "Bootstrap DNS (isimli şifreli upstream'ler için)"
msgstr "Bootstrap DNS (for named encrypted upstreams)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:48
msgid "ör. 9.9.9.9  (boş = sistem çözümleyicisi)"
msgstr "e.g. 9.9.9.9  (empty = system resolver)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:49
msgid ""
"<span class='mono'>tls://dns.google</span> / <span class='mono'>https://"
"cloudflare-dns.com/…</span> gibi <b>isimli</b> şifreli upstream'lerin host "
"adını bu düz-DNS IP'siyle çözer (IP'ye bağlanır; TLS doğrulaması yine host "
"adına yapılır). Boşsa sistem DNS'i kullanılır. Düz-IP upstream'leri "
"etkilemez."
msgstr ""
"Resolves the host name of <b>named</b> encrypted upstreams like <span "
"class='mono'>tls://dns.google</span> / <span class='mono'>https://cloudflare-"
"dns.com/…</span> using this plain-DNS IP (connects to the IP; TLS is still "
"verified against the host name). If empty, the system DNS is used. Doesn't "
"affect plain-IP upstreams."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:52
msgid "Upstream tepki süreleri (ort.)"
msgstr "Upstream response times (avg.)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/query_settings.html:55
msgid "— ölçüm yok"
msgstr "— no measurement"

