msgstr "General Settings"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:8
msgid ""
"Geçmiş, önbellek ve erişim davranışı. Çözümleme (upstream / recursion / "
"strateji) artık ayrı <b>Sorgu Ayarları</b> sayfasında. Değişiklikler "
"resolver'a ~10 sn içinde yansır (yeniden başlatma yok)."
msgstr ""
"History, cache and access behavior. Resolution (upstream / recursion / "
"strategy) is now on the separate <b>Query Settings</b> page. Changes reach "
"the resolver within ~10 s (no restart)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:23
msgid ""
"Kapalıyken sorgular veritabanına yazılmaz — Genel Bakış / Sorgu Geçmişi / "
"Analiz beslenmez (çözümleme çalışmaya devam eder)."
msgstr ""
"When off, queries aren't written to the database — Overview / Query "
"History / Analytics aren't fed (resolution keeps working)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:29
msgid "Önbellek"
msgstr "Cache"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:30
msgid ""
"Kapalıyken her sorgu baştan çözülür (yavaş ama taze). Açıkken cevaplar TTL "
"süresince bellekte tutulur."
msgstr ""
"When off, every query is resolved from scratch (slow but fresh). When on, "
"answers are kept in memory for their TTL."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:35
msgid "Min TTL (sn)"
msgstr "Min TTL (s)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:36
msgid "Max TTL (sn)"
msgstr "Max TTL (s)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:38
msgid ""
"Min TTL kısa süreli kayıtları en az bu kadar bellekte tutar (0 = dokunma); "
"Max TTL üst sınırdır."
msgstr ""
"Min TTL keeps short-lived records in memory at least this long (0 = leave "
"alone); Max TTL is the upper cap."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:44
msgid "Rate limit — istemci başına / sn"
msgstr "Rate limit — per client / s"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:45
msgid ""
"Bir istemci saniyede bu sayıdan fazla sorarsa fazlası reddedilir (REFUSED). "
"0 = kapalı."
msgstr ""
"If a client asks more than this per second, the excess is refused (REFUSED). "
"0 = off."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:49
msgid "İzinli istemciler (boş = herkes) — IP / CIDR, satır başına bir tane"
msgstr "Allowed clients (empty = everyone) — IP / CIDR, one per line"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:51
msgid "Reddedilen istemciler — IP / CIDR"
msgstr "Denied clients — IP / CIDR"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:53
msgid ""
"İzinli liste doluysa YALNIZ oradakiler sorabilir. Reddedilenler her zaman "
"engellenir (izinliden önce)."
msgstr ""
"If the allow list is non-empty, ONLY those may query. Denied clients are "
"always blocked (before the allow list)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:59
msgid "Geçmiş saklama süresi"
msgstr "History retention"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:60
msgid ""
"Bu süreden eski sorgu geçmişi otomatik silinir (saatlik kontrol). 'Kapalı' = "
"sonsuz."
msgstr ""
"Query history older than this is deleted automatically (checked hourly). "
"'Off' = forever."

